<h2 style="color:#1e40af; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 24px; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;">TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE &amp; SYSTEM DESIGN SPECIFICATION (<code style="background-color:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, Courier New, monospace; font-size:10pt; border-radius:3px;">TECHNICAL_ARCHITECTURE.md</code>)</h2>

